 },
 "about": {
  "zh": "背景本来就虚化的图用：出图后整张拉大 1.5 倍，背景不再重画；自动抠出人物，只裁出那一块，用 Tile 锁住线条重画（0.7），再缝回去。虚化原样保住，人物变清楚。背景清楚的图用「Anima · Tile 锁图」那一版。Tile 只适配 2B 的 Anima 模型，打开时会替你选一个；换成 2.9B 这类更大的会报错。",
  "en": "For a picture whose background is blurred on purpose: the whole picture enlarged 1.5x and its background left as it is; the character cut out, only its crop redrawn held by Tile (0.7) and stitched back. The blur is kept, the character gets sharper. A sharp background: the \"Anima · held by Tile\" version. The Tile fits the 2B Anima models only; it opens on one of yours, and a larger one (such as 2.9B) stops with an error."
 },
 "ai": "A pass on Anima, then the whole picture enlarged 1.5x (lanczos) and only the character redrawn: cut out, cropped with a margin, held by Anima's Tile LLLite at 0.7, redrawn at denoise 0.7 and stitched back; the background stays as enlarged. Only for a background blurred on purpose; a sharp one: the Tile version (all redrawn). open_workflow, set_model on its loader, then run_workflow with the prompt. The Tile fits the 2B Anima models only: Anomalous refuses a run where it does not fit and names the loader to change.",
